An attribute line between two sub-lists of an item makes the second a different list

```
- a
  - b
  {x}

  - c
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a</p>
    <ul>
      <li>b</li>
    </ul>
    <ul x="">
      <li>c</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  - b

  {x}
  - c
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a</p>
    <ul>
      <li>b</li>
    </ul>
    <ul x="">
      <li>c</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
> 1. a
>    1. b
>    {#i .k}
>
>    2. c
.
<blockquote>
  <ol>
    <li><p>a</p>
      <ol>
        <li>b</li>
      </ol>
      <ol start="2" id="i" class="k">
        <li>c</li>
      </ol>
    </li>
  </ol>
</blockquote>
```

```
- a
  - b
  %%

  - c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li><p>b</p></li>
      <li><p>c</p></li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```
